<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo sets 200 mln mark 4-yr step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo sets 200 mln mark 4-yr step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager WGZ.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKEN BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.0 PCT   MATURITY    20.NOV.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.25    PAY DATE    20.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.35 PCT  REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	* IN YEAR ONE, 4.75 PCT YEAR TWO, 5.50 PCT YEAR</p>
<p>		THREE AND 6.0 PCT IN YEAR FOUR.</p>
<p> LISTING    HANOVER   DENOMS (K) 10</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  1.25</p>
<p> NOTES	CALLABLE AT PAR ON 20.NOV.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
